OL,3,GNEWSAFormer soldier sentenced for child
OL,4,Asex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former soldier has been sentenced for
OL,7,Ftrying to engage in sexual activity
OL,8,Fwith a child and making, owning, and
OL,9,Fsharing indecent images of children.
OL,11,FNorth Yorkshire Police said it first
OL,12,Fbecame aware of Adam David Bonner's
OL,13,Foffending when a computer he was
OL,14,Fsuspected of using to download hundreds
OL,15,Fof indecent images of children was
OL,16,Ftraced to his Army barracks in Devon.
OL,18,FThe 19-year-old, from Middlesbrough,
OL,19,Fwas sentenced to three years and four
OL,20,Fmonths in a young offender institution
OL,21,Fat York Crown Court on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
