OL,3,GNEWSAFormer soldier sentenced for child
OL,4,Asex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe will also be put on the sex
OL,7,Foffenders register, banned from working
OL,8,Fwith vulnerable adults and children,
OL,9,Fand given a 10-year sexual harm
OL,10,Fprevention order.
